OL,3,GNEWSAFlights diverted after drones
OL,4,Aflown near airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights were diverted and cancelled
OL,7,Fafter drones entered airspace near an
OL,8,Fairport.
OL,10,FJersey Airport said three flights were
OL,11,Fdiverted back to the UK because of
OL,12,F"unauthorised drone activity" in the
OL,13,Fairport's airspace on Friday evening.
OL,15,FOnly one scheduled flight was able to
OL,16,Fland in the island at 23:45 GMT, it
OL,17,Fadded.
OL,19,FJersey Police has been approached for
OL,20,Fcomment.
